### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health

### Signup
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "fan@example.com",
  "password": "password1234",
  "nickname": "muse_fan"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "fan@example.com",
  "password": "password1234"
}

### Contents
GET http://localhost:8080/api/contents

### Content spots
GET http://localhost:8080/api/contents/1/spots

### Spot detail
GET http://localhost:8080/api/spots/1

### Generate trip
POST http://localhost:8080/api/trips/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentId": 1,
  "durationDays": 3,
  "budgetLevel": "NORMAL",
  "startLocation": "Tokyo Station",
  "travelStyle": "PILGRIMAGE_ONLY",
  "selectedSpotIds": [1, 2, 3],
  "excludedSpotIds": []
}

### Save trip
POST http://localhost:8080/api/trips/10/save
Authorization: Basic dXNlcjpwYXNzd29yZDEyMzQ=

### My trips
GET http://localhost:8080/api/trips
Authorization: Basic dXNlcjpwYXNzd29yZDEyMzQ=

### Create visit
POST http://localhost:8080/api/visits
Authorization: Basic dXNlcjpwYXNzd29yZDEyMzQ=
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "spotId": 1,
  "memo": "첫 성지 인증",
  "photoUrl": "https://example.com/photo.jpg"
}

### Booking links
GET http://localhost:8080/api/booking-links?city=Tokyo&startDate=2026-07-10&endDate=2026-07-12

